 "blinding_disclosure": "Residual leakage, stated explicitly (review fix 2). The public phantom_ri and lead_ri yes-rates in main, the public phantom_ri and lead_ri balanced accuracies, and the rounded-up discordance D_e(A4) = P(passive_ri != phantom_ri | route e) together bound passive_ri's route-e yes-rate to within about +-(D_e(A4) rounded up) of the phantom_ri yes-rate, and hence bound the A4 estimate to within about half that width. The same holds for the non-e class through D_n(A4) and the theta/open passive_ri yes-rates. These rates are published because go/no-go needs them (MP4, MF2, MF3; DESIGN.md 6.4). No primary estimate, interval or raw D is published.",
